                "Congrats! You're now officially faster than my school cup sprint. Barely.",
                "Ooh, swift! Swift like my getaway after the window incident of 1975.",
                "An epic steed! Mine was a red moped that smelled of victory and oil.",
                "Look at you fly. I flew once, off my bike, into the lake. Very fast.",
                "Congratulations! That speed would make the gym teacher drop his stopwatch.",
                "Lovely and fast. Like a summer holiday. Over too quickly, but glorious.",
                "That's how legends travel. Fast and with flair. My flair was a scarf.",
                "Bravo! You've graduated from ordinary riding. Like me from the B team.",
                "Epic indeed! The rival school would have wanted one. They had nothing on 9B.",
                "Swift as a winger! I'd know. I was the swiftest winger 9B ever had.",
                "Congrats on the upgrade. My first upgrade was a new saddle. Felt like a throne.",
