                "Bravo! You'd have been first in the school sack race. Well, first to the finish line.",
                "Congrats! You and your mount can outpace my stories. Nearly. They're long.",
                "Fast as lightning! My moped was named Lightning. Slow as thunder.",
                "A proper upgrade. Like going from the school bus to the cup final coach. Velvet seats.",
                "So proud. You're the talk of the bike rack. Faster than my old moped. Way.",
                "Bravo! That's the cherry on top. Like the cherry on the school fair cake.",
                "Epic and fast! Two things I was in 9B. Also handsome. Three things.",
                "Congrats on the epic mount. Ride it like it's the last day of ninth. Free!",
                "Splendid speed! The teachers couldn't catch me in 9B. They won't catch you either.",
                "Faster than gossip in the girls' cloakroom. That's fast.",
                "I hear thunder! Oh, it's you. Lovely mount.",
                "Hold on to your hat. I lost three hats on my moped. Worth it.",
                "In 9B you'd be crowned king of speed. I held the title until you.",
                "Out of the way, everyone! A legend is coming through. Two, counting me.",
                "The older lads at the bike rack would have gone quiet. Respect.",
                "Imagine that at the school disco car park. Everyone would stop dancing.",
                "Pure speed! I felt that way in the cup final with the ball at my feet.",
                "My moped wheezed at twenty-five. Yours sounds magnificent.",
                "You've done it! The fastest ride of all. I'd salute, but my arm's stiff.",
                "A rocket on legs! Mine was a moped on hope.",
                "Fast enough to beat the school bell. I never managed it. Not once.",
                "Speedy and shiny. Like my moped the day I bought it. Day two, less so.",
                "You'll be the legend of the road now. I was the legend of the school path.",
                "Show the youngsters how it's done. I did, in 1977, on a borrowed scooter.",
                "Your old mount must be jealous. Mine was. The bike sulked for weeks.",
                "Gosh, what an upgrade. From walking pace to flying. I'm dizzy for you.",
                "That mount could win the school cup on its own. With me on the left.",
                "My best speed record was the 60 metres. Yours is sitting under you.",
                "Off like a shot! I was off like a shot when the last bell rang. Every day.",
                "You've joined the fast and the famous. I've been a member since ninth.",
                "Real horsepower now! My moped had about half a horse. Maybe a pony.",
                "Whoosh! That's you. Wheeze. That was my moped.",
                "Impressive steed. You'd get to the class trip before the bus even left.",
                "Stunning! I'd frame a picture of it, like my moped licence.",
                "Faster than a teacher spotting chewing gum. Very fast indeed.",
                "Mind the speed bumps! Our school got one because of me. True story.",
                "Big step up from walking pace. I took that step in 1976. Never walked again.",
