                "Ride it with pride! I rode my moped with pride and a crooked helmet.",
                "Here's a mount to tell the grandchildren about. I tell mine about my moped. Weekly.",
                "Such pace! You'd beat Tom-Erik, and he had a racing bike.",
                "The fast life suits you. It suited me for one glorious summer.",
